WEBVTT

00:01:59.237 --> 00:02:01.697
And what do we get
as a consequence of that?

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:05.820
There was recently a study that looked
at all the research ever to be conducted

00:02:05.844 --> 00:02:08.638
on financial literacy --
what's called a meta-analysis.

00:02:08.662 --> 00:02:11.474
And what they found is that
when you tell people,

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:13.412
you teach them financial literacy,

00:02:13.436 --> 00:02:15.823
they learn and they remember.

00:02:15.847 --> 00:02:18.830
But do people execute? Not so much.

00:02:18.854 --> 00:02:21.103
The improvement is about
three or four percent

00:02:21.127 --> 00:02:22.988
immediately after the course,

00:02:23.012 --> 00:02:24.678
and then it goes down.

00:02:24.702 --> 00:02:26.409
And at the end of the day,

00:02:26.433 --> 00:02:30.092
the improvement is about 0.1 percent --